        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "v0nD71",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$x-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One theme axis, flipped",
          "lineHeight": 1.15,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 26,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "PLB14",
          "name": "Para",
          "fill": "$x-text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "These screens are the same nodes as their light counterparts with theme mode:dark — nothing is redrawn. Every surface reads its colour from the ramp, so a token change lands in both at once.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 12.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "nlFVZ",
          "name": "Para",
          "fill": "$x-text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Three values deliberately do not flip, because they are literals in the stylesheet too: the #7ab8ff session fence, the #16a34a “always” policy fill, and the white label on a danger-solid button. They are not part of the ramp and must stay legible on either ground.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 12.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "yXAS1",
          "name": "Para",
          "fill": "$x-text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "--lychee-limb is a token rather than a literal for the opposite reason: the mascot's limbs are specified black, but black vanishes on the dark panel, so the value has to flip to light while the fruit stays brand red.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 12.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "zfGeC",
          "name": "Para",
          "fill": "$x-text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "--accent-text goes to #1f1114 rather than black in dark mode — a near-black with a red cast, so the send button's glyph does not read as a hole punched in the accent circle.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 12.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
