                  "fill": "$s-gray",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Because repairToolCall rewrites a call to an unloaded tool into GetTool, the model can re-ask for control after a denial instead of dead-ending.",
