                          "fill": "$s-ink",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "The fix is to ship an always-on core of three and let the model list and load the rest on demand — and then to make sure a call to something it has not loaded self-heals instead of dead-ending.",
